      "kind": "annotation",
      "location": "target_workspace role (T02BETA) / base_seed.teams",
      "problem": "Product Beta workspace (T02BETA) and any associated user_teams rows are entirely absent from the supplied base_seed; the design description leaves it to the compiler to add these rows and the corresponding U_KENJI second membership.",
      "repair": "This is acceptable at design-review stage per the review rules (planned additions the compiler will create), but the compiler must ensure U_KENJI's added membership row does not conflict with the users.info single-association limitation noted above."
